      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<section id="work">
  <div class="title reveal">KARYA <span>terpilih</span></div>
  <div class="grid-2">
    <div class="project-card reveal"><div class="thumb" style="background:radial-gradient(at 30% 30%, #2a0a0a, #111)"></div><div class="meta"><h3>Website Kafe Senja</h3><p>Landing page yang naikin reservasi 40% dalam 2 minggu.</p></div></div>
